---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
seoTitle: "Biomuse — Visas, Housing, Money and Tax for People Moving Countries"
description: "Clear guides on residency routes, housing, banking, mortgages and cross-border tax for people relocating or already living abroad."
permalink: /
pageType: home
---
{% set posts = collections.articles %}
<div class="page page--single">
<main class="home">

  <section class="intro">
    <h1>{{ site.tagline }}</h1>
    <p>Practical guides on residency routes, finding somewhere to live, opening accounts, borrowing without a local credit file, and the tax that follows you across borders.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="section-head"><h2>Latest</h2></div>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in posts %}{% if loop.index <= 20 %}
    <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">
      <span class="cat">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
      <span class="t">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="d">{{ post.data.standfirst }}</span>
    </a></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="section-head"><h2>Topics</h2></div>
  <ul class="topic-list">
    {% for cat in site.categories %}
    {% set count = 0 %}{%- for p in posts -%}{% if p.data.categorySlug == cat.slug %}{% set count = count + 1 %}{% endif %}{%- endfor -%}
    <li><a href="/{{ cat.slug }}/">
      <span class="n">{{ cat.name }}</span>
      <span class="c">{{ count }}</span>
    </a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

</main>
</div>
